# The v3 line lives on the `master` branch of this same repository (tags v2.11, v3.0.0-v3.0.28).
# `v3/` is a git worktree of that branch, kept checked out because the design documents cite
# v3 source paths as behavioural evidence. It must not be tracked by the v4 branch.
v3/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Rust build output (Cargo.lock IS committed, see plan/phase1/00-overview.md OV-11)
/target/

# Local review state and scratch files
/tmp/

# Local-only: build output lives outside the synced folder (see .cargo/config.toml)
/.cargo/
